+        <label class="field ar-model" id="arModelBox" hidden><span class="label">Fine-tune</span><select id="arModel" translate="no" data-tip="The fp8 fine-tunes of Qwen-Image 2512 in artwork/Qwen-Image-2512/checkpoints/ (ComfyUI's single files): a card of 24 GB"></select></label>
